WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.095
♪ [intro music] ♪

00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:07.251
[Max] Give me one minute, 
and I'll show you

00:00:07.251 --> 00:00:10.574
how reCAPTCHA Enterprise
can keep fraudulent actors away

00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:11.988
from your online business.

00:00:12.574 --> 00:00:14.915
Each year, billions
of logins are attempted

00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:16.487
with stolen credentials.

00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:19.876
By creating synthetic accounts
or taking over real accounts,

00:00:19.877 --> 00:00:23.569
hackers can post false comments
or commit fraudulent transactions

00:00:23.569 --> 00:00:24.900
on your site.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.328
reCAPTCHA Enterprise learns

00:00:26.329 --> 00:00:28.884
by monitoring real traffic on your site.

00:00:29.049 --> 00:00:31.318
reCAPTCHA Enterprise
uses machine learning

00:00:31.319 --> 00:00:33.536
to assign a score to each request

00:00:33.537 --> 00:00:35.631
based on how likely it is legitimate.

00:00:35.928 --> 00:00:39.412
You can use the score 
and choose to take action on the request

00:00:39.413 --> 00:00:40.480
or let it through.

00:00:40.481 --> 00:00:41.607
For example,

00:00:41.615 --> 00:00:43.774
you can enforce two-factor authentication

00:00:43.775 --> 00:00:45.893
for such requests at the login page.

00:00:46.273 --> 00:00:48.344
If the user successfully authenticates,

00:00:48.345 --> 00:00:51.096
you can then annotate
the request as legitimate.

00:00:51.565 --> 00:00:55.620
This will improve reCAPTCHA's
future predictions for your site.

00:00:55.888 --> 00:00:58.452
However, if you receive
a credit card chargeback,

00:00:58.671 --> 00:01:01.187
you can annotate the request 
as fraudulent.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:03.027
In addition to the score,

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:05.447
reCAPTCHA Enterprise returns reason codes

00:01:05.448 --> 00:01:07.354
that can help you take the right action.

00:01:07.565 --> 00:01:08.573
For example,

00:01:08.574 --> 00:01:11.035
if the reason indicates an automated bot,

00:01:11.035 --> 00:01:12.717
you might throttle the request

00:01:12.718 --> 00:01:14.710
or send posts to the moderators.

00:01:15.015 --> 00:01:17.467
reCAPTCHA Enterprise works with backends

00:01:17.468 --> 00:01:21.413
running on third-party clouds,
on-premises, and Google Cloud.

00:01:21.901 --> 00:01:25.162
It also supports mobile
as well as web applications.

00:01:25.493 --> 00:01:28.262
So next time you're looking
to keep fraudulent bots away

00:01:28.263 --> 00:01:31.159
from your online business
without extra friction,

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:33.548
take a minute to explore
reCAPTCHA Enterprise.

00:01:33.799 --> 00:01:35.084
To learn more,

00:01:35.085 --> 00:01:39.005
check out
<i>cloud.google.com/recaptcha-enterprise</i>.

00:01:39.915 --> 00:01:41.939
♪ [outro music] ♪

